# 69.0: GEMINI_API_KEY da bi LOAI BO cung voi `GeminiClient` trong app. Repo
# chua tung co secret nay, nen nut chon Gemini chi bao "chưa có khoá" — nguoi
# dung yeu cau xoa. Con mot nha cung cap AI duy nhat: Orcarouter (bên dưới).
# Muon mo lai Gemini thi phai them lai client + provider + secret, dung co
# them chuoi khoa that vao bat cu file nao trong repo nay.

# OPENROUTER_API_KEY: khoa goi cac model DeepSeek / GLM trong bo chon model cua
# tro ly gia dinh (openrouter.ai -> Keys). CUNG THU TUC NHU TREN: tao Repository
# Secret ten `OPENROUTER_API_KEY`, workflow ghi vao `.env` (da bi .gitignore),
# BuildConfig sinh truong tu `.env`. Chua co secret thi build van xanh va man
# hinh AI hoi khoa lan dau tien chon model OpenRouter.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=REPLACE_ME_WITH_YOUR_OPENROUTER_API_KEY
